# Build-context ignore rules for Dockerfile.models only.
# BuildKit uses <dockerfile-path>.dockerignore in preference to the root
# .dockerignore. This file is a copy of the root .dockerignore WITHOUT the
# models/ entry, because packaging models/ is the entire purpose of this build.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
tests/
src/ClientApp/
src/HybridApp/
src/eShop.AppHost/
